Open Command Code with a model

Usage: wally command-code [OPTIONS] [args...]

Arguments:
  args                        Passed through to the tool

Options:
  -h, --help                  Show help
  -m, --model TEXT            A model on this machine, or a hosted one from your
                              account

Examples:
  # Download the certified local model once
  wally models pull qwen3-4b-instruct-2507

  # Start the tool with the certified local model
  wally command-code -m qwen3-4b-instruct-2507

  # Use a cloud model after wally account login
  wally command-code -m glm-5.3-flash
